Like I said, I never used the ring of conflict, wearing free action and +3
damage or levitation instead.  The zoo in the wizard's tower was a mess due to
liches; I stoned a few and ended up charming most of the monsters and running.
A master mind flayer was off in an earlier room, neener.  I charmed lots of
undead and insects in the sanctum too, used 2 cursed potions of gain level,
and made a 3rd to get out of the Valley.  Then a rapid ascent due to 19
scrolls of teleport, and a fairly fast endgame.  Due to Amulet mana drain I
stopped being so much of a wizard, using wands of death and teleport even
though I knew the spells, though I also cast charm monster a fair bit.  My
altar turned out to be behind Pestilence (always my first choice) and I
ascended, having seen not a single Archon, despite being level 30.  Not that
I'm complaining.

